[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=Google Chrome
GenericName=Web Browser
Comment=Not installed yet — click to install Google Chrome
Comment[es]=Aún no instalado — haga clic para instalar Google Chrome
Comment[de]=Noch nicht installiert — klicken, um Google Chrome zu installieren
Comment[fr]=Pas encore installé — cliquez pour installer Google Chrome
Comment[pt]=Ainda não instalado — clique para instalar o Google Chrome
Comment[ru]=Ещё не установлен — нажмите, чтобы установить Google Chrome
Comment[el]=Δεν έχει εγκατασταθεί ακόμη — κάντε κλικ για εγκατάσταση του Google Chrome
Comment[ar]=غير مُثبَّت بعد — انقر لتثبيت Google Chrome
Comment[he]=עדיין לא מותקן — לחצו כדי להתקין את Google Chrome
Comment[fa]=هنوز نصب نشده — برای نصب Google Chrome کلیک کنید
Comment[ku]=Hê nehatiye sazkirin — ji bo sazkirina Google Chrome bitikîne
Comment[ckb]=هێشتا دانەمەزراوە — کلیک بکە بۆ دامەزراندنی Google Chrome
Comment[syr]=ܠܐ ܐܬܬܣܝܡ ܥܕܟܝܠ — ܢܩܘܫ ܠܡܣܡ Google Chrome
# PLACEHOLDER. Bashan OS ships NEITHER the Chrome package nor an enabled
# Google repository: the repository file is shipped as .disabled, so nothing
# contacts dl.google.com until the user asks for Chrome.
# This entry holds the dock slot and installs Chrome on click. It lives at
# the same path the real google-chrome.desktop uses, so the dock pin carries
# over untouched; the installer copies it to
# /usr/share/bashan/google-chrome-placeholder.desktop and moves it aside
# before dpkg unpacks. If Chrome is later removed,
# /usr/libexec/bashan/chrome-placeholder-sync puts it back and switches the
# repository off again.
Exec=/usr/bin/bashan-install-chrome
Icon=google-chrome
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=true
Categories=Network;WebBrowser;
Keywords=chrome;browser;google;
